    {
      "id": "claim_5d9e4177c2d4425ba375117fd3860da0",
      "statement": "The behavioral test suite is 41 pytest tests across six files (tests/test_client.py, tests/test_marketplace.py, tests/test_policy.py, tests/test_registry.py, tests/test_registry_client.py, tests/test_server.py) and runs with plain pytest after pip install -e \".[dev]\"; pytest>=7.0 is the only dev dependency and each test module inserts the repository root into sys.path so no plugin or conftest wiring is needed.",
