      "statement": "The suite's fixtures (two_agents, pair, business, registry, directory) create real identities and Directory state under pytest tmp_path per agent and always build HAAPServer/RegistryServer with AuditLog(memory=True); they never touch ~/.haap, and the only sockets opened are 127.0.0.1 ThreadingHTTPServers bound to ephemeral ports, while client-side network helpers (haap.client._fetch_json) are monkeypatched in tests instead of hitting the network.",
