    {
      "id": "claim_93b3872f71ba4b9886bf48434d166891",
      "statement": "tests/test_server.py closes with two surface tests: well_known_manifest() must expose the agent fingerprint and speciality with no private key material, and test_http_layer_end_to_end boots the real ThreadingHTTPServer on 127.0.0.1 with port 0, GETs /health, POSTs a signed hello to /haap/messages over the live socket, and asserts the hello_ack challenge comes back.",
