      "statement": "tests/test_marketplace.py pins the no-friendship marketplace mode with self-signed bootstrap envelopes carrying the sender's public key: service_search answers service_quote with availability and the matched catalog, service_book under auto_accept executes the injected on_task and returns a completed task_result, disabling auto_accept rejects bookings with an error naming auto_accept, the dedicated marketplace bucket (capacity 10, refill 0.05/s) throttles a 12-request burst after the first requests pass, and a directory-blocked sender gets PERMISSION_DENIED.",
