      "statement": "tests/test_registry_client.py runs one full discovery story: register() from haap.registry_client performs submit, nonce signing and completion against a live RegistryServer on an ephemeral loopback port, heartbeat() works for the registered agent, and a second agent finds it by capability citas-peluqueria and by free text peluqueria with the correct fingerprint and messaging endpoint.",
